<dashboard version="1.1" theme="dark">
  <label>AI Data Center Fabric - RoCE v2 (MV-002)</label>
  <description>PFC buffer utilization, ECN marking, and loss-less RDMA fabric telemetry during AI all-reduce gradient synchronization.</description>
  
  <row>
    <panel>
      <title>Network Topology Diagram &amp; Flow Architecture (MV-002)</title>
